---
description: The engineering loop
applyTo: "**"
---

Every change that lands as a PR runs the `engineering-loop` skill, unless your personal instructions say `Engineering loop: off` and `docs/agents/gatekeeper.md` sets `opt_out: true` under `loop`. Its project facts are in `docs/agents/`.

`loop:approvals` rejects a PR whose description has no `## Evidence` section.
